        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.564,
            0.836,
            0.584
          ],
          "content": "Based on the dot plots, which of the following statements are true?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.589,
            0.737,
            0.609
          ],
          "content": "(a) The data varies more for the boys than for the girls."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.613,
            0.847,
            0.653
          ],
          "content": "(b) The median number of pockets for the boys is more than that for the girls."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.657,
            0.847,
            0.697
          ],
          "content": "(c) The mean number of pockets for the girls is more than that for the boys."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.701,
            0.847,
            0.741
          ],
          "content": "(d) The maximum number of pockets for boys is greater than that for the girls."
        },
        {
